<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūbertas</span></b> , ātis,
			f.
		puber, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the age of manhood</i> or <i>maturity</i>, <i>puberty.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">primis pubertatis annis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					9, 6, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab initio pubertatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					23, 1, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">35, 2, 2</span></i>;
			and: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circa pubertatem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					25, 13, 95, § 154</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pubertatis et primae adulescentiae tempus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 1</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">differetur quaestio in tempus pubertatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 37, 10, 1, § 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">37, 10,
				7, § 3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The signs of puberty</i>, <i>the
			beard</i>, etc., <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 33, 86</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 16,
				17, § 76</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 26, 97, §
			170</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Of plants, <i>soft down</i>, <i>pubescence</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 23</span></i>, praef. 4, §
			7.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Manhood</i>, <i>virility</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inexhausta pubertas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. G.
					20, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Youth</i>, <i>young persons</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pubertas canis suum honorem reddebat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 2, 1, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dux pubertatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Prov. 2, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
